t bracket on the second and third row outboard seat strikers, free of charge.  The recall began December 19, 2019.  Owners may contact FCA US customer service at 1-800-853-1403.  FCA's number for this recall is V91.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":30354,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=19V759000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":1,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2019","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"18V523000","received":"2018-08-09","manufacturer":"Chrysler (FCA US LLC)","component":"SERVICE BRAKES, HYDRAULIC:FOUNDATION COMPONENTS:DISC:CALIPER","summary":"Chrysler (FCA US LLC) is recalling certain 2018-2019 Dodge Grand Caravan and Jeep Compass, 2018 Dodge Journey, and 2019 Jeep Cherokee vehicles.  The rear brake caliper pistons on these vehicles may have an insufficient coating causing gas pockets to form, potentially reducing rear brake performance.","consequence":"A reduction of braking performance can increase the risk of a crash.","remedy":"Chrysler will notify owners, and dealers will bleed the vehicle's brake system, free of charge.  The recall began September 29, 2018.  Owners may contact Chrysler customer service at 1-800-853-1403.  Chrysler's number for this recall is U86.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":154335,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=18V523000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":6,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2019","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2019","make":"JEEP","model":"COMPASS"},{"year":"2018","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2018","make":"DODGE","model":"JOURNEY"},{"year":"2019","make":"JEEP","model":"CHEROKEE"},{"year":"2018","make":"JEEP","model":"COMPASS"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"20V278000","received":"2020-05-15","manufacturer":"Vantage Mobility International, LLC","component":"FUEL SYSTEM, GASOLINE:STORAGE:TANK ASSEMBLY","summary":"Vantage Mobility International, LLC  (Vantage) is recalling certain Vantage-modified 2016-2019 Dodge Grand Caravan vehicles.  The fuel pump gasket may deteriorate, allowing fuel to leak.","consequence":"A fuel leak in the presence of an ignition source can increase the risk of a fire.","remedy":"Vantage will notify owners, and will provide parts and reimbursement to owners for repair facilities to replace the fuel tank gasket, free of charge.  The recall began May 19, 2020.  Owners may contact Vantage customer service at 1-800-488-9082.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":122,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=20V278000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":4,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2018","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2019","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2016","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2017","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"25V876000","received":"2025-12-18","manufacturer":"Rollx Vans","component":"EQUIPMENT ADAPTIVE/MOBILITY:WHEELCHAIR RESTRAINTS/SECUREMENT:LATCH/ANCHOR:","summary":"Rollx Vans (Rollx) is recalling certain GMC Yukon, Sierra, Chevrolet Express 2500, Ford Transit, E-250, Toyota Sienna, Sienna Hybrid, Honda Odyssey, Chrysler Town and Country, Voyager, Pacifica, Dodge Grand Caravan, and Ram Promaster vehicles equipped with QRT-Deluxe and QRT-Max wheelchair restraints. Please refer to Rollx's recall report for specific model year information. The retractors may not lock, preventing the wheelchair from being properly secured.","consequence":"An unsecured wheelchair can move during transit, increasing the risk of injury.","remedy":"Rollx will work with Q'Straint to inspect and replace the retractors as necessary, free of charge. Owner notification letters were mailed February 5, 2026. Owners may contact Rollx's customer service at 1-800-956-6668.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":86,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=25V876000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":52,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2024","make":"TOYOTA","model":"SIENNA HYBRID"},{"year":"2023","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"VOYAGER"},{"year":"2024","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"PACIFICA"},{"year":"2024","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"VOYAGER"},{"year":"2024","make":"RAM","model":"PROMASTER"},{"year":"2024","make":"FORD","model":"TRANSIT"},{"year":"2025","make":"TOYOTA","model":"SIENNA HYBRID"},{"year":"2025","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"PACIFICA"},{"year":"2025","make":"RAM","model":"PROMASTER"},{"year":"2025","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"VOYAGER"},{"year":"2025","make":"GMC","model":"YUKON"},{"year":"2025","make":"GMC","model":"SIERRA 1500"},{"year":"2025","make":"FORD","model":"TRANSIT"},{"year":"2021","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"PACIFICA"},{"year":"2010","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2012","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2013","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2014","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2015","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2019","make":"FORD","model":"TRANSIT"},{"year":"2019","make":"RAM","model":"PROMASTER"},{"year":"2011","make":"FORD","model":"E-250"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"}],"campaign_vehicles_tr